{"3873970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NASCAR 25", "steam_appid": 3873970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4132630, 4132390, 4132400, 4132410], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRacing is proud to present NASCAR 25, the official game of NASCAR featuring ALL FOUR National Series, the ARCA Menards Series, NASCAR Xfinity Series, NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, and NASCAR Cup Series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NASCAR 25 will feature all the action you've come to expect from the developers of the most authentic racing experience and simulation ever created. In addition, iRacing has brought laser scanned car models and tracks for a level of authenticity that is previously unmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a physics model tuned by the experts, and based on real world feedback from actual NASCAR drivers and race teams, you'll be immersed in the sights and sounds of race day like never before. From Quick Race, Championship, Multiplayer, or Career, the combinations of tracks, cars, and experiences will keep you coming back for more. Work your way from your backyard shop in ARCA Menards series all the way through a multi-time NASCAR Cup Series Champion in Career Mode, and show the world what you're made of. It's the NASCAR game you've been waiting and asking for! Welcome to NASCAR 25!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRacing is proud to present NASCAR 25, the official game of NASCAR featuring ALL FOUR National Series, the ARCA Menards Series, NASCAR Xfinity Series, NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, and NASCAR Cup Series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NASCAR 25 will feature all the action you've come to expect from the developers of the most authentic racing experience and simulation ever created. In addition, iRacing has brought laser scanned car models and tracks for a level of authenticity that is previously unmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a physics model tuned by the experts, and based on real world feedback from actual NASCAR drivers and race teams, you'll be immersed in the sights and sounds of race day like never before. From Quick Race, Championship, Multiplayer, or Career, the combinations of tracks, cars, and experiences will keep you coming back for more. Work your way from your backyard shop in ARCA Menards series all the way through a multi-time NASCAR Cup Series Champion in Career Mode, and show the world what you're made of. It's the NASCAR game you've been waiting and asking for! Welcome to NASCAR 25!</p>", "short_description": "iRacing is proud to present NASCAR 25, the official game of NASCAR featuring ALL FOUR National Series, the ARCA Menards Series, NASCAR Xfinity Series, NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, and NASCAR Cup Series.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873970/5993fe7123701b2a7baa25b60d728dd7787de3bf/header.jpg?t=1766082114", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873970/1ac961fa0c08c1d2a52767b4358ed2f72a3d5d99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766082114", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873970/1ac961fa0c08c1d2a52767b4358ed2f72a3d5d99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766082114", "website": "https://nascar25.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit, Windows 11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core CPU or better – Some examples (but not limited to): AMD FX-6300, Intel Core i5-4430, Intel Core i5-2320, AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A gaming graphics card with at least 4GB of DEDICATED memory – Some examples (but not limited to): Nvidia GeForce GT